WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.553
DidaRec records your screen, your webcam and your voice — right in the browser. Nothing to install, no account.

2
00:00:04.553 --> 00:00:09.637
Turn on your microphone and webcam.

3
00:00:09.637 --> 00:00:13.785
Select Screen asks your browser what to share — a screen, a window or a tab. (A stand-in here.)

4
00:00:13.785 --> 00:00:20.341
Click Record. DidaRec saves as you go, so a crash can't lose your work.

5
00:00:20.341 --> 00:00:23.443
Pause whenever you like. Each pause starts a new part you can work on later.

6
00:00:23.443 --> 00:00:40.511
While paused you can change the screen, switch the webcam off, mute the mic — or fill the picture with your webcam.

7
00:00:40.511 --> 00:00:47.433
Stop & review shows every part. Play one on its own, delete it, or replace it with a new take.

8
00:00:47.433 --> 00:00:50.825
Save as is writes one video file. Chrome asks where to put it. (A stand-in here.)

9
00:00:50.825 --> 00:00:55.338
Free and open source. Your video stays on your computer.  bluebrazelton-dotcom.github.io/DidaRec
